cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gstar-weight-equivalence: code and data for 'A block bootstrap equivalence test for the choice of spatial weight matrix in space-time autoregressive models'"
abstract: "Code and data that reproduce the simulation study and the rainfall application of the paper: an equivalence (TOST) test of whether two spatial weight matrices give the same value of a reported quantity in a GSTARX(1;1) model, with a moving-block bootstrap of the influence sequence, applied to monthly CHIRPS rainfall for 40 regions of Indonesia and its neighbours."
authors:
